# The Founder Guide PDF. Readable locally and used as the specification, but
# deliberately not tracked: it is a binary naming four real people and their
# financial arrangements, so distributing it is the owners' decision rather
# than a side effect of a commit. It has been committed by accident twice.
*.pdf

