CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md

# Locally rendered document previews. Artefacts of a design sitting.
.render/

# KSDRILL SA company registration and FICA documents (CIPC forms, tax number,
# business account agreement/resolution). Real PII and financial documents,
# never meant to enter version control. Currently also caught by the *.pdf
# rule above, but that rule exists for an unrelated reason and could change —
# this folder gets its own explicit, permanent rule.
/ksdrill/
